{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:55:11+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ile d'Or", "steam_appid": 3561770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4650660], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ile d'Or is a maritime trading simulation game in which you earn funds through trade, gather companions, and strengthen your own fleet. Destroy the fortresses of hostile factions, invest in port towns, and report the discoveries made on land expeditions to gain Influence with each nation and aim for supremacy over the seas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Captain Registry</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras/0f4967daf58c660e37c2a52ed6bba001.avif?t=1793529973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras_big/0f4967daf58c660e37c2a52ed6bba001.avif?t=1793529973 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin by registering your Captain. Choose your name, faction name, occupation, appearance and colors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Home Port</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras/48d9a5dadc70341dd76e388dca710455.avif?t=1793529973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras_big/48d9a5dadc70341dd76e388dca710455.avif?t=1793529973 width=800 height=450 /></span>Choose the faction you like from nine available factions. Your choice changes the story and your relationships with the other factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy local specialty goods and sell them in other towns to earn silver. Goods a port town lacks, or specialties in high demand, fetch correspondingly higher prices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras/06909359caeccfdd3f311fd3de55a680.avif?t=1793529973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras_big/06909359caeccfdd3f311fd3de55a680.avif?t=1793529973 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight hostile factions and Bounties to obtain ship parts, equipment, and clues to exploration sites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras/156853a0bcde94c87f107041f565cdfe.avif?t=1793529973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras_big/156853a0bcde94c87f107041f565cdfe.avif?t=1793529973 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shipbuilding</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fight powerful enemies, you need powerful ships. Shipbuilding consumes a great deal of materials, so keep gathering them through land expeditions and by converting trade goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras/7e5e4c07f98c5a6b40ad2e7a0c266a71.avif?t=1793529973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras_big/7e5e4c07f98c5a6b40ad2e7a0c266a71.avif?t=1793529973 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expeditions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather the materials you need for shipbuilding while searching for clues to hidden treasure. Report the treasures you discover to the Governor's Office to gain Influence and precious gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras/e0fbe34a419d961a5d903bd73995ec08.avif?t=1793529973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras_big/e0fbe34a419d961a5d903bd73995ec08.avif?t=1793529973 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ile d'Or is a maritime trading simulation game in which you earn funds through trade, gather companions, and strengthen your own fleet. Destroy the fortresses of hostile factions, invest in port towns, and report the discoveries made on land expeditions to gain Influence with each nation and aim for supremacy over the seas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Captain Registry</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras/0f4967daf58c660e37c2a52ed6bba001.avif?t=1793529973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras_big/0f4967daf58c660e37c2a52ed6bba001.avif?t=1793529973 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin by registering your Captain. Choose your name, faction name, occupation, appearance and colors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Home Port</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras/48d9a5dadc70341dd76e388dca710455.avif?t=1793529973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras_big/48d9a5dadc70341dd76e388dca710455.avif?t=1793529973 width=800 height=450 /></span>Choose the faction you like from nine available factions. Your choice changes the story and your relationships with the other factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy local specialty goods and sell them in other towns to earn silver. Goods a port town lacks, or specialties in high demand, fetch correspondingly higher prices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras/06909359caeccfdd3f311fd3de55a680.avif?t=1793529973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras_big/06909359caeccfdd3f311fd3de55a680.avif?t=1793529973 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight hostile factions and Bounties to obtain ship parts, equipment, and clues to exploration sites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras/156853a0bcde94c87f107041f565cdfe.avif?t=1793529973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras_big/156853a0bcde94c87f107041f565cdfe.avif?t=1793529973 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shipbuilding</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fight powerful enemies, you need powerful ships. Shipbuilding consumes a great deal of materials, so keep gathering them through land expeditions and by converting trade goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras/7e5e4c07f98c5a6b40ad2e7a0c266a71.avif?t=1793529973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras_big/7e5e4c07f98c5a6b40ad2e7a0c266a71.avif?t=1793529973 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expeditions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather the materials you need for shipbuilding while searching for clues to hidden treasure. Report the treasures you discover to the Governor's Office to gain Influence and precious gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras/e0fbe34a419d961a5d903bd73995ec08.avif?t=1793529973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/extras_big/e0fbe34a419d961a5d903bd73995ec08.avif?t=1793529973 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A maritime trading game built on three pillars: Trade, Expeditions and Battle. Earn silver to grow your crew, build mighty ships from expedition materials, and win your battles. Balance the three as you like. Rival factions vie for these waters; your story choices decide who becomes ally or enemy.", "supported_languages": "Japanese, English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/1d6ca1a3348c36d2fab349c679182b74672454da/header.jpg?t=1793529973", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/97ef57c9ca76858eb0142468b321dcf4b3a00be2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793529973", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561770/97ef57c9ca76858eb0142468b321dcf4b3a00be2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793529973", "website": "https://atorasoft.pages.dev/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10以降 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> インテル(R)Core(TM) i5-7400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX